# Welcome to calq, a notepad that does math with units.
# Edit anything. Click an answer to copy it.

1 m/s * 3 years in km
5 ft + 3 inches in cm
3 cups in ml

# Name things, then build on them
distance = 420 miles
speed = 65 mph
distance / speed in hours
fuel = distance / (32 miles/gallon)
fuel * 4.29 USD/gallon

# Money, science and data
40 hr * 52 * 25 USD/hr
π * (6 inch)^2 in cm^2
c * 1 ms in km
1 GB / (100 Mbit/s) in s
